00:15:21.186 --> 00:15:23.654
I didn't think she was that ugly!

00:15:23.989 --> 00:15:25.991
Let's send her home!

00:15:25.991 --> 00:15:28.459
She's so unpleasant that I can't
even concentrate! You know?

00:15:30.529 --> 00:15:34.266
I'll just be counting on you for the rest.
Now I've got a new concept.

00:15:34.266 --> 00:15:36.791
I'm going to keep the momentum
and snap away!

00:15:37.369 --> 00:15:38.597
H.. Hey...

00:15:38.938 --> 00:15:40.530
I quit.

00:15:40.806 --> 00:15:41.874
What?

00:15:41.874 --> 00:15:44.604
Wait! What are you talking about?

00:15:44.877 --> 00:15:47.680
Jeez, what am I going to do with you?

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:50.046
Hey, Yuki, you know what?

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.142
Sunako...

00:15:53.085 --> 00:15:56.221
They said this place isn't haunted anymore,

00:15:56.221 --> 00:15:58.519
so let's go home.

00:15:58.657 --> 00:16:00.459
Hold on a second.

00:16:00.459 --> 00:16:03.189
What do you think you're doing?
You have to explain what's going on.

00:16:05.597 --> 00:16:09.268
Don't tell me you got bothered by me
talking bad about the girl?

00:16:09.268 --> 00:16:10.496
Ridiculous!

00:16:14.506 --> 00:16:16.008
Do whatever you want!

00:16:16.008 --> 00:16:17.343
What the hell?

00:16:17.343 --> 00:16:19.178
Mr. Kinoyama, what's going on?

00:16:19.178 --> 00:16:20.846
What the hell is your problem?!

00:16:20.846 --> 00:16:23.515
You're a man, but you look
like a frickin' doll!

00:16:23.515 --> 00:16:27.519
But you can't even act like a girl!
That's just rude!

00:16:27.519 --> 00:16:30.356
Whoa! You're talking like a woman!

00:16:30.356 --> 00:16:32.187
His anger meter has reached its max!

00:16:32.391 --> 00:16:35.360
Make up your damn mind, you half-ass man!

00:16:40.165 --> 00:16:44.236
Half-ass... Half-ass... Half-ass...

00:16:44.236 --> 00:16:45.637
Hey, Yuki! Get a hold of yourself!
Half-ass... Half-ass... Half-ass...

00:16:45.637 --> 00:16:46.126
Hey, Yuki! Get a hold of yourself!

00:16:54.713 --> 00:16:56.180
Th.. That's my camera!

00:16:56.448 --> 00:16:58.250
My expensive camera!

00:16:58.250 --> 00:16:58.717
Mr. Kinoyama, please keep your composure!
My expensive camera!

00:16:58.717 --> 00:17:00.082
Mr. Kinoyama, please keep your composure!

00:17:00.552 --> 00:17:07.159
Y.. Y.. You'd better pay for it!

00:17:07.159 --> 00:17:08.285
Huh?

00:17:09.094 --> 00:17:12.197
Pay for it? Pay for what? Pay how much?

00:17:12.197 --> 00:17:14.290
I... I'd better run!

00:17:20.706 --> 00:17:22.574
What was that?

00:17:22.574 --> 00:17:24.201
So, there is a ghost?

00:17:25.044 --> 00:17:27.012
Ghost?!

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:30.271
How exciting!

00:17:31.283 --> 00:17:33.519
Hey, Sunako! Be careful!

00:17:33.519 --> 00:17:35.646
It's no use. She's on cloud nine.

00:17:40.059 --> 00:17:41.356
Kyohei!

00:17:42.061 --> 00:17:45.064
You tried to bail out without us, didn't you?
I won't forgive you for that!

00:17:45.064 --> 00:17:47.032
Be.. Because we have to pay for...

00:17:48.834 --> 00:17:50.392
Hey, Kyohei!

00:17:51.804 --> 00:17:53.138
No ghost...

00:17:53.138 --> 00:17:55.874
Sunako, let's get out of here.

00:17:55.874 --> 00:17:56.975
Hold it right there!

00:17:56.975 --> 00:18:00.879
Do any of you have the slightest idea what
it means to be photographed by me?!

00:18:00.879 --> 00:18:04.116
It would no longer be a dream to
instantly enter the limelight

00:18:04.116 --> 00:18:06.311
and stand there in front of the whole world!

00:18:12.758 --> 00:18:14.350
We're not interested.

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:15.986
What?

00:18:32.311 --> 00:18:34.113
Mr. Kinoyama, are you okay with this?

00:18:34.113 --> 00:18:36.047
They're really going to run away!

00:18:38.584 --> 00:18:39.551
Y.. Yes, sir!

00:18:46.692 --> 00:18:48.927
I had no idea that's what happened.

00:18:48.927 --> 00:18:53.296
If I hadn't been injured, I'd have
kicked the cameraman's ass!

00:18:54.133 --> 00:18:56.235
Actually, I'm glad you were injured.

00:18:56.235 --> 00:18:58.430
Hey, aren't you angry?

00:18:58.904 --> 00:19:02.840
I'm over it! Sunako got angry for me anyway.

00:19:03.342 --> 00:19:05.276
I guess it's all right if you say so.

00:19:06.545 --> 00:19:07.569
Hey!

00:19:08.113 --> 00:19:10.877
We got the money! 500,000 yen!

00:19:11.016 --> 00:19:12.751
Huh? But why?

00:19:12.751 --> 00:19:14.878
You did it, Yuki!

00:19:15.787 --> 00:19:17.015
Stop it!

00:19:18.023 --> 00:19:20.526
An invitation to his photo
exhibition is in here too.

00:19:20.526 --> 00:19:22.828
What should we do? Wanna go check it out?

00:19:22.828 --> 00:19:25.194
No way! I don't like that guy!

00:19:25.497 --> 00:19:27.766
But we can't just take the
money and do nothing.

00:19:27.766 --> 00:19:29.893
Sure, let's go check it out!

00:19:35.741 --> 00:19:37.876
There are more people in here than I expected.

00:19:37.876 --> 00:19:39.673
Yeah, I guess he's popular.

00:19:42.414 --> 00:19:43.472
Huh?

00:19:44.249 --> 00:19:47.085
Excuse me, you're the guys
in the photos, right?

00:19:47.085 --> 00:19:49.053
All four of you look really cool!

00:19:49.454 --> 00:19:51.581
C.. Cool?

00:19:52.257 --> 00:19:53.417
The four of us?

00:19:53.492 --> 00:19:54.618
Dinner Under the Moon

00:19:59.298 --> 00:20:00.799
When did he take that?

00:20:00.799 --> 00:20:03.825
Boy, he got us, didn't he?

00:20:04.036 --> 00:20:06.505
"D.. Dinner"?!

00:20:06.505 --> 00:20:08.373
Am I their food?!

00:20:08.373 --> 00:20:10.500
How dare he take this without permission?

00:20:11.243 --> 00:20:14.508
Calm down! At least he paid us, you know!

00:20:14.846 --> 00:20:16.575
Good for you!

00:20:18.183 --> 00:20:19.384
Auntie?!

00:20:19.384 --> 00:20:21.978
I got the invitation, so I stopped by.

00:20:22.321 --> 00:20:24.122
It's fabulous!

00:20:24.122 --> 00:20:28.559
Everyone's saying that this will end up
being one of his masterpieces.

00:20:28.760 --> 00:20:30.862
Hey, give back the money!

00:20:30.862 --> 00:20:33.298
You haven't paid the rent
for a while, you know.

00:20:33.298 --> 00:20:36.134
I got hurt doing this!
I had to get seven stitches!

00:20:36.134 --> 00:20:37.936
I have medical expenses!

00:20:37.936 --> 00:20:38.270
Get out of here.
I have medical expenses!

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:39.294
Get out of here.

00:20:39.605 --> 00:20:40.731
Damn!

00:20:41.073 --> 00:20:42.665
One, two, three...

00:20:43.008 --> 00:20:45.340
Listen to me when I'm talking to you!

00:20:45.877 --> 00:20:48.505
That's 500,000 yen even! Thanks!

00:20:51.516 --> 00:20:53.252
She's a demon.

00:20:53.252 --> 00:20:55.153
I see a demon in front of me.

00:20:55.153 --> 00:20:58.690
Okay, I have to go now! I've got an akasuri
body-scrub appointment in Korea!

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:01.093
You guys continue to take care
of Sunako for me, okay!

00:21:01.093 --> 00:21:03.996
Ahn nyung hee ke se yo!
Ttoe maha-na bho-she-da!

00:21:03.996 --> 00:21:06.865
Guys! So you made it!

00:21:06.865 --> 00:21:09.167
I truly owe you guys big-time!

00:21:09.167 --> 00:21:12.000
This exhibition is a huge success,
all thanks to you!

00:21:12.304 --> 00:21:15.707
I'm just glad that it didn't damage
the reputation of Kinoyama,

00:21:15.707 --> 00:21:17.209
the international photographer.

00:21:17.209 --> 00:21:20.212
Should I just beat his ass up
to vent my anger?

00:21:20.212 --> 00:21:21.546
I'm not going to stop you.

00:21:21.546 --> 00:21:26.677
By the way, didn't that captivatingly
beautiful girl Sunako come?

00:21:27.219 --> 00:21:29.779
These guys want to interview her.

00:21:30.656 --> 00:21:33.225
Oh, tres bien, Sunako!

00:21:33.225 --> 00:21:35.661
Beautiful, Sunako!

00:21:35.661 --> 00:21:38.221
Khorosho, Sunako!

00:21:38.563 --> 00:21:42.431
Now that I think about it, we did force her
to get in the cab with us, but...

00:21:46.938 --> 00:21:49.406
She... She's not here! She didn't come!

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:54.608
She said she didn't feel good or something.

00:21:59.918 --> 00:22:02.045
I want this!

00:22:02.321 --> 00:22:05.256
The Beautiful One's Banquet

00:22:06.425 --> 00:22:10.987
What I managed to obliterate

00:22:14.066 --> 00:22:20.403
Was a bunch of blades

00:22:21.707 --> 00:22:29.079
I loved it like this, waiting, waiting

00:22:29.548 --> 00:22:36.784
With felt petals, waiting

00:22:37.456 --> 00:22:44.828
I can't see you anymore, waiting, waiting

00:22:45.564 --> 00:22:53.271
I just keep on waiting in a sea without you

00:22:53.271 --> 00:23:00.677
I loved it like this, waiting, waiting

00:23:00.946 --> 00:23:08.148
The felt petals, waiting

00:23:08.787 --> 00:23:12.057
We won't see each other anymore

00:23:12.057 --> 00:23:16.289
Waiting, waiting

00:23:17.028 --> 00:23:24.992
I will probably be waiting in a sea without you

00:23:31.276 --> 00:23:33.311
Hell no, I'm not gonna do the housework!

00:23:33.311 --> 00:23:34.379
Don't say that!

00:23:34.379 --> 00:23:35.180
This button needs to be sewed back on!

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:35.714
I'll take care of that!
This button needs to be sewed back on!

00:23:35.714 --> 00:23:36.348
I'll take care of that!

00:23:36.348 --> 00:23:37.149
My shirt is wrinkled!

00:23:37.149 --> 00:23:37.349
I'll take care of that!
My shirt is wrinkled!

00:23:37.349 --> 00:23:38.350
I'll take care of that!

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:39.017
I'm hungry!

00:23:39.017 --> 00:23:39.351
I'll take care of that!
I'm hungry!

00:23:39.351 --> 00:23:40.018
I'll take care of that!

00:23:40.018 --> 00:23:41.153
What kind of robot is that?

00:23:41.153 --> 00:23:42.120
Chi-chiki-chi!

00:23:42.120 --> 00:23:43.955
I'm scared! I'm so scared!

00:23:43.955 --> 00:23:45.657
Dreamy Halloween
Next time on The Wallflower:
" Dreamy Halloween" !

00:23:45.657 --> 00:23:45.690
Next time on The Wallflower:
" Dreamy Halloween" !

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:46.792
She's a weirdo!

00:23:46.792 --> 00:23:47.918
Chi-chiki-chi!

